# AutoPM project record. Plain text on purpose: it is meant to be read
# and diffed. Keys are screen.field, matching the files in definitions/.
# provenance is one of specified, agreed, unobjected. Anything else is
# untagged, and only specified and agreed count as decisions.

project: autopm
name: AutoPM
accent: #B05CF6
created: 2026-09-15
modified: 2026-09-15
phase: Executing
summary: |
  Building my own project management software, run as a managed project from
  day one. The product does three jobs: a study guide for the PM role, a
  practical application I run real projects in, and where my projects live
  afterwards.

  This record is record #1: the tool's own project, managed inside the tool.
