field requirements.assumptions
  provenance: unobjected
  evidence: Drafted by the delivery team 2026-09-15, not yet reviewed
  value: |
    The Qt 6.8 toolchain stays working on this machine for the length of the
    project.
    The PMBOK 6th edition field lists stay the reference, even though later
    editions moved to principles.
    Definition files stay hand-editable; nobody needs a definition editor UI.
field requirements.constraints
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Stack and packaging decided 2026-09-15 ("go with recommended stack")
  value: |
    Windows only. C++17, Qt 6.8.3, MSVC 2022.
    $0 budget.
    No code signing certificate, so installers are unsigned.
    Records must stay plain text and diffable, because Archon reviews them.
