field stakeholders.strategy
  provenance: unobjected
  evidence: Proposed 2026-09-15 as Q10. No reply yet, so this is not a decision.
  value: |
    Proposed: give Archon the charter up front, so "right" is judged against
    written criteria rather than discovered at the review. And hold his review once
    M4 is reached rather than on October 15, so there is slack left to fix what he
    finds.

    Neither has been answered. Chase or drop.
