field status.summary
  provenance: unobjected
  evidence: Drafted by the delivery team 2026-09-15
  value: |
    All eleven lifecycle screens are built and usable on this project's own
    record. Initiating and Planning are filled in; Executing is in progress;
    Closing is empty on purpose.

    Closeout date unchanged at October 15. The open question is Archon's review
    timing, proposed on 09-15 and still unanswered.
